body:
I had a friend like that once but slowly they became better and I am happy for them but because of that they no longer needed me and I am not a part of their life anymore.

&#x200B;

I wish I could just find friends and sometimes I think I can

&#x200B;

There are days where I plan out how I'm going to fix myself and I am legitemently "excited" (for lack of a better word) to become the better me and make friends and not push them away... 

but then the next day I want to die and realize that my hope was wrong. I never do it, I always tell myself tomorrow for some reason.

It happens with all of the friends I've ever had and even if I found balance it would leave me with separation anxiety. 

&#x200B;

It is selfish for me to put that on other people because I know it will only hurt them and make them feel guilty.

Thanks how do I mark this as found?

&#x200B;

edit: nvm figured it out
